OL,3,AMountain of broken fridges growing
OL,4,Aacross England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mountain of broken fridges is
OL,7,Fbuilding up in waste centres across
OL,8,FEngland and Wales, the Local Government
OL,9,FAssociation (LGA) has warned.
OL,11,FThis year's multiple heat waves have
OL,12,Fincreased the numbers of white goods
OL,13,Fsuch as fridges and freezers breaking
OL,14,Fdown and needing to be scrapped at
OL,15,Fspecialist sites.
OL,17,FDozens of councils have been forced to
OL,18,Fstop collections of white goods due to
OL,19,Fa major backlog, which has built up due
OL,20,Fto a national shortage of specialists
OL,21,Fneeded to safely process the
OL,22,Fappliances.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
