OL,3,AMountain of broken fridges growing
OL,4,Aacross England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this month, Prime Minister Andy
OL,7,FBurnham announced the latest crackdown
OL,8,Fon illegal waste dumps - and the LGA is
OL,9,Fnow calling on the government to take
OL,10,Furgent action on dealing with white
OL,11,Fgoods too.
